    "diagramHtml": "\n<div class=\"diagram-wrapper\">\n  <div class=\"diagram-header\">\n    <div class=\"diagram-badge\">BATCH 03 VISUAL GUIDE</div>\n    <h4>The workspace: a fenced tenant, and the work that lives in it</h4>\n    <p>82 of 144 tables carry workspace_id; members, issues, projects and the code link sit inside the fence</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"diagram-svg-container\">\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 920 350\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n\n      <defs>\n        <marker id=\"arr-03\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n          <path d=\"M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"var(--diagram-accent, #7c3aed)\"/>\n        </marker>\n        <marker id=\"arrg-03\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n          <path d=\"M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#10b981\"/>\n        </marker>\n        <marker id=\"arrr-03\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\">\n          <path d=\"M 0 1 L 8 5 L 0 9 z\" fill=\"#ef4444\"/>\n        </marker>\n      </defs>\n      <rect x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"880\" height=\"150\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" fill-opacity=\"0.4\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"6,4\"/>\n      <text x=\"40\" y=\"46\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1d4ed8\">THE TENANT FENCE — 144 tables, 82 carry workspace_id</text>\n      <g transform=\"translate(40, 60)\">\n        <rect width=\"200\" height=\"96\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--text-primary, #0f172a)\">MEMBERS</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">owner | admin | member</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">invitations: 7-day expiry</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#059669\">last owner protected (x3)</text>\n      </g>\n      <g transform=\"translate(256, 60)\">\n        <rect width=\"200\" height=\"96\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--text-primary, #0f172a)\">ISSUES</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">32 columns</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">number · stage · triage_state</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#b45309\">metadata + typed properties</text>\n      </g>\n      <g transform=\"translate(472, 60)\">\n        <rect width=\"200\" height=\"96\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--text-primary, #0f172a)\">PROJECTS</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">status · priority · dates</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">lead: member OR agent</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#059669\">polymorphic resources</text>\n      </g>\n      <g transform=\"translate(688, 60)\">\n        <rect width=\"200\" height=\"96\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-card, #ffffff)\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"26\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"var(--text-primary, #0f172a)\">CODE</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"44\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">workspace.repos (url + ref)</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"61\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">github_installation (multi-ws)</text>\n        <text x=\"12\" y=\"78\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#059669\">issue ↔ PR join</text>\n      </g>\n      <rect x=\"20\" y=\"196\" width=\"430\" height=\"136\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#2563eb\" fill-opacity=\"0.08\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n      <text x=\"38\" y=\"222\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1d4ed8\">TWO CUSTOM-FIELD LAYERS, DELIBERATELY SPLIT</text>\n      <text x=\"38\" y=\"246\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">issue.metadata (105) — a free jsonb bag for MACHINES, 8 KB, primitives</text>\n      <text x=\"38\" y=\"266\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">issue_property + issue.properties (191) — a TYPED catalog for PEOPLE, 16 KB</text>\n      <text x=\"38\" y=\"290\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">values are keyed by definition UUID, so a rename never rewrites data</text>\n      <text x=\"38\" y=\"314\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1d4ed8\">Definitions are archived, never deleted — history stays resolvable.</text>\n      <rect x=\"470\" y=\"196\" width=\"430\" height=\"136\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#ef4444\" fill-opacity=\"0.08\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n      <text x=\"488\" y=\"222\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#b91c1c\">THREE DESIGN DECISIONS RECORDED IN MIGRATIONS</text>\n      <text x=\"488\" y=\"246\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">• triage moved OFF status onto its own column (483)</text>\n      <text x=\"488\" y=\"266\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">• a duplicate is a cancelled issue with a pointer (536)</text>\n      <text x=\"488\" y=\"286\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--text-secondary, #475569)\">• stages are barrier groups among siblings (123)</text>\n      <text x=\"488\" y=\"312\" font-family=\"system-ui, sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#b91c1c\">The migration chain, not the schema, is the durable truth.</text>\n    </svg>\n  </div>\n</div>",
